[25.646711, "o", "\u001b[26X\u001b[9d\u001b[33X\u001b[11d        \u001b[12;46H            \u001b[13;46H\u001b[14X\u001b[14d\u001b[31X\u001b[15d             \u001b[20;46H\u001b[34m───────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[22;47H\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[mparar · interrompe\u001b[23;49Hperfil leitura|completo · troca o perfil do agente do modo atual nesta\u001b[24;46Hsessão             \u001b[25;3H\u001b(B\u001b[0;2mdom 11/10\u001b[26;3H 3 \u001b(B\u001b[0m\u001b[36m14:00 \u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[mVisita ao novo escritório\r\u001b[28d\u001b[34m│\u001b[28;43H││\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m Segurança\u001b[120G\u001b[34m│\u001b[29;1H│\u001b[29;43H││\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m   Só rodam os comandos da lista: sem shell, PATH e ambiente fixos,\u001b[120G\u001b[34m│\u001b[30;46H\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[mtempo-limite e saída limitada.\u001b[31;48HO HUD nunca escreve no Vault. Texto de fora tem as sequências de escape\u001b[32;46Hremovidas.\u001b[20X\u001b[33;46H\u001b[32mpasta: /tmp/hud-demo/projeto-exemplo · lembrada para a próxima vez\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m       \u001b[34;46H\u001b(B\u001b[0;2mclaude e codex agora trabalham e leem nesta pasta; conversa nova\u001b[35;67H\u001b(B\u001b[0m\u001b[32mVault (de volta ao Vault)\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[20X\u001b[39;5H            \u001b[5G"]
